WEBVTT

00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:07,050
Hi, I'm Dr. Kevin Cutters. Thanks for requesting a download of my book, Stop Fighting Cancer, and Start Treating the Cause.

00:00:07,050 --> 00:00:15,050
Over the last several years, I've offered this book online and have had literally thousands of downloads from all over the world.

00:00:15,050 --> 00:00:17,050
But I discovered a problem.

00:00:17,050 --> 00:00:22,050
When you are a loved one or diagnosed with cancer, it can be a very scary thing.

00:00:22,050 --> 00:00:26,050
You can be bombarded with information from a variety of different sources.

00:00:26,050 --> 00:00:31,050
And I know that this is a lot of data as well, and I don't want to contribute to you being overwhelmed.

00:00:31,050 --> 00:00:36,050
So instead of simply giving you my book, I'm going to give you a program.

00:00:36,050 --> 00:00:45,050
I've divided this book into small, bite-sized pieces, and added specific topics that will help you along your journey.

00:00:45,050 --> 00:00:52,050
With each section, you'll receive a short video similar to this that will help explain the material.

00:00:52,050 --> 00:00:59,050
I know you have many difficult decisions to make, and I want this program to be a blessing to help you move forward.

00:00:59,050 --> 00:01:06,050
And always, if you have any questions, call by personal assistant immediately.

